{
  "version": 1,
  "storyId": "gulliver",
  "source": "Gemini AI Studio chapter WAVs from the user (gemini-3.8-flash-tts), cut into sentences at the quietest frame between Whisper word times",
  "alignment": "Every sentence clip transcribed by Whisper large-v3-turbo and medium; chapter transcripts exact in both models apart from number formatting; clip-level lay/laid and sea to/seat to judged coarticulation; human listening not yet verified",
  "chapters": {
    "storm": {
      "sourceSha256": "a2e474fcf5f4f4b27288468be3b01c5aeb93999f6e3f52cf91a8ff67979b58bb",
      "durationSeconds": 27.53,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s01.wav",
          "text": "Long ago, a ship doctor named Gulliver loved to sail to faraway lands.",
          "durationMs": 5840.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.84,
          "sha256": "5f885f4497c87660af25ff5812b1b505f33f9111a60f69664c7905b88ac29788"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s02.wav",
          "text": "One night, a terrible storm hit his ship.",
          "durationMs": 3740.042,
          "startSeconds": 5.84,
          "endSeconds": 9.58,
          "sha256": "761ff2703a1b3cd53330d23c4a25b49cf60b16d0a756773f862e7a0a83480f45"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s03.wav",
          "text": "Big waves broke the ship, and Gulliver fell into the cold sea.",
          "durationMs": 4620.0,
          "startSeconds": 9.58,
          "endSeconds": 14.2,
          "sha256": "c6d973e694b05d676df8499d4e3942e4323d9d9ff912053be34bbed5c5518751"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s04.wav",
          "text": "He swam and swam until his feet touched the sand.",
          "durationMs": 4530.0,
          "startSeconds": 14.2,
          "endSeconds": 18.73,
          "sha256": "5ea1289de9c0523098f5b093cc28c95dad7349deb6aba29e353b10762afdbfd0"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s05.wav",
          "text": "He was so tired that he lay down on the soft grass.",
          "durationMs": 4110.0,
          "startSeconds": 18.73,
          "endSeconds": 22.84,
          "sha256": "585e58db299777c3921c945d8117b674de0d623d7957af77fa56dc007fe6dd1e"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/storm/s06.wav",
          "text": "Soon, he fell fast asleep under the stars.",
          "durationMs": 4690.042,
          "startSeconds": 22.84,
          "endSeconds": 27.53,
          "sha256": "0f86efdcca2a5102282eff54aa48e42594163f10e558af156817e4b2798668bc"
        }
      ]
    },
    "tied": {
      "sourceSha256": "52412d086336c193150a154d6a13079674f089b2beacf550663f27a299d094be",
      "durationSeconds": 35.64,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s01.wav",
          "text": "When Gulliver woke up, the sun was shining, but he could not move!",
          "durationMs": 5390.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.39,
          "sha256": "7ffe8b5bd757aaaf271e43dd12eb946c0fa01b3739112768376975a02980d881"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s02.wav",
          "text": "His arms, his legs and even his long hair were tied down with tiny ropes.",
          "durationMs": 6390.0,
          "startSeconds": 5.39,
          "endSeconds": 11.78,
          "sha256": "6c8674b64cf98e93068a31a178b706cf4873de15aacb244eff9763135b8c3c6a"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s03.wav",
          "text": "Then something walked up his leg and stood on his chest.",
          "durationMs": 5390.0,
          "startSeconds": 11.78,
          "endSeconds": 17.17,
          "sha256": "fd1b0dd2ef614bf72971cd9019a8736a4ed9ae39ce89c27f43926553a65f7a7d"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s04.wav",
          "text": "It was a little man, no bigger than Gulliver's finger!",
          "durationMs": 5170.0,
          "startSeconds": 17.17,
          "endSeconds": 22.34,
          "sha256": "a47d416c519668d1f9ff1cd9da51303719713393b1e0519b9105576c66e895fe"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s05.wav",
          "text": "Hundreds more stood around him with tiny bows and arrows.",
          "durationMs": 4020.042,
          "startSeconds": 22.34,
          "endSeconds": 26.36,
          "sha256": "5006359123878668f12da95b15d6b3beaeba64e24d017433103c82f78b1cedd9"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s06.wav",
          "text": "The arrows felt like needles. \"Ouch!\" cried Gulliver.",
          "durationMs": 4550.0,
          "startSeconds": 26.36,
          "endSeconds": 30.91,
          "sha256": "7da19982554f4506c6ea3c9d5a92979b71063ed68b4b457a2591ef689866a411"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/tied/s07.wav",
          "text": "He rubbed his face and decided to be gentle with the tiny people.",
          "durationMs": 4730.0,
          "startSeconds": 30.91,
          "endSeconds": 35.64,
          "sha256": "9c87162a4db27b343e52e36ae6f6b9f8d4ecc99df07ba5a7629837d587c52acf"
        }
      ]
    },
    "food": {
      "sourceSha256": "e58f68cc4dac152a6c70d04c9034d8a058291eda98041096c4b3ba1982a3fd61",
      "durationSeconds": 34.45,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s01.wav",
          "text": "Gulliver pointed to his mouth. He was very, very hungry.",
          "durationMs": 4430.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.43,
          "sha256": "a6bde968588914c59e8425986dbe5eb920be6b6531aaec689c6808fa5b65212e"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s02.wav",
          "text": "The little people climbed up ladders with baskets of food.",
          "durationMs": 4470.0,
          "startSeconds": 4.43,
          "endSeconds": 8.9,
          "sha256": "4f9f6364de62b51922345e2a15a6b2435aea7b5fc12246c67139d33da747e702"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s03.wav",
          "text": "Each loaf of bread was as small as a cookie, so he ate three at a time.",
          "durationMs": 5780.0,
          "startSeconds": 8.9,
          "endSeconds": 14.68,
          "sha256": "678f13d15fc4edfb5e5ce5871e6962b93302868c21208605bb7b491c9a55ce87"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s04.wav",
          "text": "He drank a whole barrel of milk in just one sip.",
          "durationMs": 4030.0,
          "startSeconds": 14.68,
          "endSeconds": 18.71,
          "sha256": "7f99bf1a6d9ab42de9796c0fc682bddb89a7c2e6ab0366663217dfdf532d3ade"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s05.wav",
          "text": "The tiny people cheered and danced on his hand.",
          "durationMs": 4040.0,
          "startSeconds": 18.71,
          "endSeconds": 22.75,
          "sha256": "a7c53c5f4f62c93a52937edc7cb8f2b5cfac7b32aa4549c99e62c25eaee10701"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s06.wav",
          "text": "Then nine hundred workers lifted him onto a giant wagon.",
          "durationMs": 6009.958,
          "startSeconds": 22.75,
          "endSeconds": 28.76,
          "sha256": "3c93ccc2642ef0fb11a4e3e55938ec856635e6e56cb6c8d990f11049741ce3c7"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/food/s07.wav",
          "text": "Fifteen hundred little horses pulled him all the way to their city.",
          "durationMs": 5689.958,
          "startSeconds": 28.76,
          "endSeconds": 34.45,
          "sha256": "8e6cdb0217ae2b28d2e8b6c25609f609d118e9aac5dab96b5e333afd68890c91"
        }
      ]
    },
    "pockets": {
      "sourceSha256": "fe59f9ea1a9544714a8d1e8520a4d4d9bc3334cd69ae7814e3c5b8e8f7046db1",
      "durationSeconds": 37.51,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s01.wav",
          "text": "The country was called Lilliput, and it had a tiny emperor.",
          "durationMs": 4830.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.83,
          "sha256": "055f01f5460fe8a815c98f0bbec23b45b5692e8c35c810cf4b3953dc29fad21a"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s02.wav",
          "text": "The emperor rode up on his little horse and looked up bravely.",
          "durationMs": 5180.0,
          "startSeconds": 4.83,
          "endSeconds": 10.01,
          "sha256": "825c41fc6ecbb68ac20781a28ab1e9e191089449810f38043dcba876c3ea7c82"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s03.wav",
          "text": "\"Promise to be our friend, and we will set you free,\" he said.",
          "durationMs": 4700.0,
          "startSeconds": 10.01,
          "endSeconds": 14.71,
          "sha256": "e409b71ae44af9b7bd133630225ce41ac2d181e05b87308c9520b793bc160029"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s04.wav",
          "text": "Gulliver promised, and two officers climbed into his pockets to search them.",
          "durationMs": 4920.0,
          "startSeconds": 14.71,
          "endSeconds": 19.63,
          "sha256": "b9704162088be7c5557e49a379f9ce47e8f3fd88e39543caf6a50586ccbbd3ad"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s05.wav",
          "text": "They found a huge silver box full of brown dust that made them sneeze.",
          "durationMs": 6040.0,
          "startSeconds": 19.63,
          "endSeconds": 25.67,
          "sha256": "a00737fd40ca95daa123a6454132780bce6b142f063254b93d0a4646dc296483"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s06.wav",
          "text": "Then they found a strange machine that went tick, tick, tick.",
          "durationMs": 5589.958,
          "startSeconds": 25.67,
          "endSeconds": 31.26,
          "sha256": "25e6e679710963bd9d3f18b75f2f6d98e03c9292a52e4ea0ef2c769ced0f4b2e"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/pockets/s07.wav",
          "text": "\"It must be his god,\" they whispered, \"because he looks at it all the time!\"",
          "durationMs": 6250.0,
          "startSeconds": 31.26,
          "endSeconds": 37.51,
          "sha256": "b17a0d81496e2d87c2a3275473562c64c367e000b557e81cb24f7d30b99a549c"
        }
      ]
    },
    "eggs": {
      "sourceSha256": "ccca2a267472a283fe53237aa65226091795b4a0526f2f3731d274f8e36709e2",
      "durationSeconds": 35.78,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s01.wav",
          "text": "Soon, Gulliver became good friends with the little people.",
          "durationMs": 4270.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.27,
          "sha256": "4d69e1ecc1baea35c66206635f0fe0e1e29c91d7784f94454941f902c18cc3cd"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s02.wav",
          "text": "One day, a wise old minister told him a secret.",
          "durationMs": 4979.958,
          "startSeconds": 4.27,
          "endSeconds": 9.25,
          "sha256": "efe88754b515caf914570989310de06662fa11f70edc443befd968d49cd7ae6b"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s03.wav",
          "text": "Lilliput was at war with Blefuscu, an island across the sea.",
          "durationMs": 6280.0,
          "startSeconds": 9.25,
          "endSeconds": 15.53,
          "sha256": "3ded85bcede4be2b15a7c2e1d8d04351839e323b25fd7c12ffccc7e7964617cc"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s04.wav",
          "text": "And do you know why? It was all about eggs!",
          "durationMs": 4650.0,
          "startSeconds": 15.53,
          "endSeconds": 20.18,
          "sha256": "92d733dc7b6ff2cad3ab8131f0ea08acf71729102f5aa343b1a67c85c233e6d7"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s05.wav",
          "text": "In Lilliput, people had to break their eggs on the small end.",
          "durationMs": 4290.0,
          "startSeconds": 20.18,
          "endSeconds": 24.47,
          "sha256": "9910d49ec6eaa2e55e276cd1c159742050c8fce93443a3c0ab2bccfda86721de"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s06.wav",
          "text": "But in Blefuscu, people broke their eggs on the big end.",
          "durationMs": 4819.958,
          "startSeconds": 24.47,
          "endSeconds": 29.29,
          "sha256": "9267b76c0a92c1e15f0994191b0fb765e76dc7212c4a11972f1b5026866b4623"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/eggs/s07.wav",
          "text": "Gulliver tried hard not to laugh. \"A war about eggs?\" he thought.",
          "durationMs": 6490.0,
          "startSeconds": 29.29,
          "endSeconds": 35.78,
          "sha256": "c2cd116b1a8acabee51e7984f5c976fb483290d4853e6781e83b1f110178b80e"
        }
      ]
    },
    "fleet": {
      "sourceSha256": "c1b7e3f9a4284ab817ef59e4ca071306dfc3e5022fef63467512c623c01f4462",
      "durationSeconds": 29.29,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s01.wav",
          "text": "Soon, fifty warships from Blefuscu were ready to attack Lilliput.",
          "durationMs": 5399.958,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 5.4,
          "sha256": "dd25287b0a5df05c1a52634a7b134e1448b65e244816705ba0a9bcd52d7a4001"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s02.wav",
          "text": "Gulliver had a clever plan. He made fifty strong hooks.",
          "durationMs": 5320.0,
          "startSeconds": 5.4,
          "endSeconds": 10.72,
          "sha256": "84e1bff155cc5cc924545eab6cc8fdb58ee902f45b995b5421a83dc47a23cf31"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s03.wav",
          "text": "He walked into the sea. The deep water came only up to his chest.",
          "durationMs": 4640.0,
          "startSeconds": 10.72,
          "endSeconds": 15.36,
          "sha256": "5077a2feac86608ce0bebc412843d4387c651a221962d0957968e56d6c92cb88"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s04.wav",
          "text": "Enemy soldiers shot arrows, so he put on his glasses to save his eyes.",
          "durationMs": 5290.0,
          "startSeconds": 15.36,
          "endSeconds": 20.65,
          "sha256": "e2147a38eed151d56e6893a885e7b68356b98447e88556b9db210c0ef186cf16"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s05.wav",
          "text": "He hooked every ship and pulled them all back to Lilliput!",
          "durationMs": 4120.0,
          "startSeconds": 20.65,
          "endSeconds": 24.77,
          "sha256": "33ddb2a834ad4d059491f46afb9784fb1387125483437e833e78e75b44b59146"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fleet/s06.wav",
          "text": "\"Long live the great Gulliver!\" shouted the little people.",
          "durationMs": 4520.0,
          "startSeconds": 24.77,
          "endSeconds": 29.29,
          "sha256": "01b6f11969f4c88d55c7d34eca6a29fe569ca07431bc7641c7018e4d2f31f135"
        }
      ]
    },
    "fire": {
      "sourceSha256": "1273ab35eb26f9ad94171053c69035b6f277a6a71a036b32b1f7a987aaf51a13",
      "durationSeconds": 34.06,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s01.wav",
          "text": "One night, Gulliver heard tiny bells ringing everywhere.",
          "durationMs": 4910.0,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.91,
          "sha256": "13bdd64e5f7f03af46ca7a158b9f1be9408e67875947abd197fe8c81e1abbe88"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s02.wav",
          "text": "The royal palace was on fire!",
          "durationMs": 2880.0,
          "startSeconds": 4.91,
          "endSeconds": 7.79,
          "sha256": "1486652982a306dac9c3208ef2861c2275c204533b3ed38ee0626f6b1252481f"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s03.wav",
          "text": "The little people threw water with buckets as small as teacups.",
          "durationMs": 4280.0,
          "startSeconds": 7.79,
          "endSeconds": 12.07,
          "sha256": "7fe32be7289534cc0d2d54223ae58a0c75d15604f3432bef5ffd971b48fa91e9"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s04.wav",
          "text": "But it was not enough. The fire grew bigger and bigger.",
          "durationMs": 4600.042,
          "startSeconds": 12.07,
          "endSeconds": 16.67,
          "sha256": "2e0e02ecbc3256e250caa01ec227ac53661905791d11cb67dd48571b65a32a23"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s05.wav",
          "text": "Gulliver filled his hat with water from the lake and poured it on the palace.",
          "durationMs": 4830.0,
          "startSeconds": 16.67,
          "endSeconds": 21.5,
          "sha256": "40eaf5a0a1327d3f41fdd2ef4fb33e64737c3937c5927f36e0957cd381aca207"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s06.wav",
          "text": "Splash! The fire went out, and the palace was safe.",
          "durationMs": 5450.0,
          "startSeconds": 21.5,
          "endSeconds": 26.95,
          "sha256": "b37ec45e3fb2b81d0af94e999d188638a0660f1e0dd7f0a645cceda5577b5afe"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/fire/s07.wav",
          "text": "But some ministers frowned. \"He is too big and too dangerous,\" they said.",
          "durationMs": 7110.0,
          "startSeconds": 26.95,
          "endSeconds": 34.06,
          "sha256": "80a4e8e02ab08d69a36f0b4954a7e08e70f5467371d5c5f4f97f859a902f574a"
        }
      ]
    },
    "home": {
      "sourceSha256": "c5330281c4073c429eca24df79d46722e9583323619e729fc4e7d7f95f2e09c1",
      "durationSeconds": 37.25,
      "clips": [
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/home/s01.wav",
          "text": "Late one night, the wise minister came to see Gulliver in secret.",
          "durationMs": 4829.958,
          "startSeconds": 0.0,
          "endSeconds": 4.83,
          "sha256": "9b986fbccb7c9a551d4ac646fb0c6506eef1d0b7be65bf1bbbeecbd8448ec5dd"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/home/s02.wav",
          "text": "\"Some people want to hurt you. You must leave now!\" he whispered.",
          "durationMs": 5059.958,
          "startSeconds": 4.83,
          "endSeconds": 9.89,
          "sha256": "6401643fdf225a89732a52fca35b44e4bd37146b2d3d68540082ff0cc34d9c59"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/home/s03.wav",
          "text": "So Gulliver walked across the sea to Blefuscu.",
          "durationMs": 3520.042,
          "startSeconds": 9.89,
          "endSeconds": 13.41,
          "sha256": "9cca3f528d8d276f2e933e9618ecba9873e5d4bd9685bbb391157a7e8518f9af"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/home/s04.wav",
          "text": "There, on the beach, he found a real boat, just his size!",
          "durationMs": 5169.958,
          "startSeconds": 13.41,
          "endSeconds": 18.58,
          "sha256": "e04c6d8c226a7ace043b47ed3273ef38bb0946fd9b889e896faef28d7ac063bf"
        },
        {
          "src": "/story-audio/gulliver/f9b5def39285/home/s05.wav",
          "text": "He cleaned and fixed the old boat, and the people gave him food for the trip.",
          "durationMs": 4290.0,
          "startSeconds": 18.58,
          "endSeconds": 22.87,
